# Reserved golden-master TEST-DATA folder (authorized by NY4I, 2026-07-05).
#
# The repo root ignores *.TRW / *.CFG and log exports on purpose, so nobody
# ever commits real operating logs. The curated regression fixtures HERE are the
# one sanctioned exception: re-include them for this subtree only. Everywhere
# else in the repo, the root ignores still apply unchanged.
!*.trw
!*.TRW
!*.cfg
!*.CFG
!*.adi
!*.ADI
!*.cbr
!*.CBR

# D12 candidate exports are transient golden_diff inputs, regenerated each
# run from the D12 build -- outputs to compare, not fixtures to track.
cand.adi
cand.cbr

# So is the export named after the log itself. The !*.adi/!*.ADI above is a
# BLANKET re-include: it readmits every ADIF in this subtree, artifacts
# included, which is how a 375 KB log.ADI came to be sitting beside a ref.adi
# as an untracked file nobody had noticed (2026-08-26). Only ref.* is a
# fixture here; everything else an export run drops is transient.
log.adi
log.ADI
log.cbr
log.CBR
